    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids</a></i></p><p>A <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> sometimes needs to be stowed in places where it usually would not fit. For example, a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> stowed in a smaller cargo space might surprise an enemy. The Collapsible Construction modification allows a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> to lower its size category by one when it shuts down. The Droid Brain enters stand-by mode while it compacts itself into a smaller size. The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> can reactivate at any time as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>.</p>",
    "source": "Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids",
